een-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Moisture Control:</b> Essential for chemical reactions that require dry air.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Noise Reduction:</b> Proper fan balancing reduces floor vibration.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Documented History:</b> Vital for industrial and environmental compliance.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-red-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-800\">Disadvantages of Neglect (Cons)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Rapid Coil Decay:</b> Chemical air eats into unprotected coils within months.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Fire Hazards:</b> Built-up lint and industrial dust in ducts can be flammable.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Machine Overheating:</b> Process cooling fails when AHU performance drops.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Poor Air Hygiene:</b> Microbial growth in humid AHU drain pans.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Excessive Vibration:</b> Unserviced fans can damage the structural casing.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>High Replacement Cost:</b> Buying a new AHU is 10x more expensive than maintenance.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Breach of Safety:</b> Risking workers&#8217; health leads to legal liabilities.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ERROR CODES -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8\">Common Industrial AHU Alerts</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-6 bg-gray-50 border rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">DP Alarm</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\">Differential Pressure high. Filters are completely choked with industrial particles.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 bg-gray-50 border rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">VFD Fault</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\">Variable Frequency Drive trip. Often due to motor overheating or voltage surges.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 bg-gray-50 border rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">Freeze Stat</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\">Coil temperature too low. Risk of ice formation and pipe bursting.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 bg-gray-50 border rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">Smoke Trip</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\">Smoke detected in return air. Critical alarm; check fire dampers immediately.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Bharuch AHU Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">1. Do you provide service for AHUs in Dahej SEZ?</h4>\n                 